{"id":"635387","name":"红豆馒头","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/635387/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"1000克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"10克"}],"sub":[{"name":"红豆","amount":"100克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红豆煮至软烂，晾凉至35度。","img":"images/635387/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"面粉、白糖和酵母粉混合。","img":"images/635387/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入红豆和汤水。","img":"images/635387/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成软硬适中的面团。","img":"images/635387/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"静置发酵。","img":"images/635387/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"夏天发酵时间短，很快就发起来了，大蜂窝状。","img":"images/635387/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一份揉成圆形馒头。","img":"images/635387/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入蒸锅，二次发酵。","img":"images/635387/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"发酵后，大火蒸制20分钟，焖3分钟出锅。","img":"images/635387/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切片看看，口感暄软，红豆的香味很诱人。","img":"images/635387/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"早餐主食。","img":"images/635387/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}